WEBVTT

00:00:01.760 --> 00:00:04.600
Winter
Daphne Inn

00:00:08.600 --> 00:00:11.220
I didn't expect you to come back.

00:00:12.680 --> 00:00:13.930
Chitose...

00:00:13.930 --> 00:00:16.100
Captain Inukai was here a second ago.

00:00:16.100 --> 00:00:18.650
He wrote the whole thing off
as "accidental discharge".

00:00:19.150 --> 00:00:20.550
We're closed for the night.

00:00:24.000 --> 00:00:26.030
I'll resume work tomorrow.

00:00:26.950 --> 00:00:28.980
Really? Glad to hear it.

00:00:33.200 --> 00:00:35.150
You should go to bed for the night.

00:00:36.170 --> 00:00:39.510
We can't have the customers
seeing you look piqued.

00:00:40.750 --> 00:00:42.590
Chitose, thank you.

00:00:43.210 --> 00:00:44.170
Huh?

00:00:44.630 --> 00:00:45.770
You're a good person.

00:00:46.260 --> 00:00:48.180
Excuse me? Was that sarcasm?

00:00:48.720 --> 00:00:51.280
You know I've never picked on you.

00:00:51.890 --> 00:00:54.780
That's why I said you're a good person.

00:01:00.310 --> 00:01:02.290
My throat is burning...

00:01:05.110 --> 00:01:05.790
It's strange.

00:01:06.910 --> 00:01:11.200
My body should be to the point
where it no longer craves anything...

00:01:13.810 --> 00:01:14.420
Kohaku?

00:01:16.250 --> 00:01:16.930
Hey!

00:01:17.370 --> 00:01:19.300
Why is it so hard for me to...

00:01:19.540 --> 00:01:20.460
...resist it...?

00:01:20.460 --> 00:01:22.310
Are you sure you aren't sick?

00:01:22.530 --> 00:01:24.060
...this craving?

00:01:30.220 --> 00:01:33.600
The air is rather rich with the
stench of blood tonight, isn't it?

00:01:34.640 --> 00:01:35.820
So it would seem.

00:01:36.390 --> 00:01:37.730
Come to think of it,

00:01:37.730 --> 00:01:39.820
in exchange for that pretty eye,

00:01:40.400 --> 00:01:42.500
what did you offer the young woman?

00:01:43.600 --> 00:01:44.280
Nothing.

00:01:46.250 --> 00:01:50.510
After all... I couldn't give a rat's ass
about some pathetic woman's desires.

00:03:28.960 --> 00:03:32.710
In the end, Satomi never did come
back last night, did he?

00:03:30.800 --> 00:03:35.050
Compensation

00:03:33.130 --> 00:03:34.680
Do you think he is busy?

00:03:35.510 --> 00:03:36.610
Can't say.

00:03:36.890 --> 00:03:40.010
Although it is unusual for
him to demand a change

00:03:40.010 --> 00:03:41.400
of clothes in the morning.

00:03:41.400 --> 00:03:43.360
We could have delivered it on our own.

00:03:43.940 --> 00:03:45.330
I had nothing to do anyway.

00:03:45.770 --> 00:03:48.870
Plus I've always wanted to
visit the Kenro Hotel...

00:03:48.870 --> 00:03:55.380
Kenro Hotel

00:03:49.780 --> 00:03:51.810
It's basically Rio's secret hideout.

00:03:52.320 --> 00:03:54.070
I wonder if he has a lover
stashed away in there.

00:03:54.450 --> 00:03:55.760
A lover?!

00:03:56.790 --> 00:03:57.380
What's this?

00:03:57.720 --> 00:03:59.570
Is that a faint barrier?

00:04:05.580 --> 00:04:09.260
Rio! I brought the stuff,
just like you asked!

00:04:09.550 --> 00:04:11.590
Kaname? Over here.

00:04:12.320 --> 00:04:13.070
Rio?

00:04:14.960 --> 00:04:15.840
Yeah.

00:04:16.540 --> 00:04:18.010
Sorry to trouble you first
thing in the morning.

00:04:18.800 --> 00:04:20.400
I was unable to pull myself away...

00:04:24.660 --> 00:04:27.350
No!

00:04:27.980 --> 00:04:31.280
R-Rio, even you play around, huh?
You are a guy and all!

00:04:31.280 --> 00:04:32.410
What are you talking about?

00:04:32.410 --> 00:04:34.960
But you have a most
unusual fetish, Satomi.

00:04:34.490 --> 00:04:36.850
Shh! Tenko, everyone has their thing...

00:04:36.850 --> 00:04:37.670
What is this about?

00:04:43.290 --> 00:04:46.090
I was sold in the spring
of my eighth year.

00:04:47.420 --> 00:04:50.470
Children with blond hair
and golden eyes were rare,

00:04:50.870 --> 00:04:52.680
which made the brothel
owner most pleased.

00:04:55.990 --> 00:04:58.730
After that, I no longer had to starve...

00:04:59.430 --> 00:05:01.370
I no longer shivered in the cold...

00:05:02.560 --> 00:05:04.860
The women in the red-light
district treated me kindly.

00:05:06.230 --> 00:05:08.630
But once I began to accept customers,

00:05:09.190 --> 00:05:11.460
their attitudes suddenly changed.

00:05:12.480 --> 00:05:15.750
That's when I grew numb to everything...

00:05:16.480 --> 00:05:19.270
I forgot about my village,
my parents' faces

00:05:20.050 --> 00:05:21.510
and that I had siblings...

00:05:27.080 --> 00:05:28.320
What an unpleasant dream.

00:05:36.940 --> 00:05:39.470
What... did I...?

00:05:44.750 --> 00:05:46.200
I wonder why.

00:05:49.060 --> 00:05:50.480
My throat...

00:05:50.480 --> 00:05:51.490
...feels so dry!

00:05:52.030 --> 00:05:55.040
KONA-YA

00:05:52.690 --> 00:05:55.040
Are you certain you don't
want to accompany us?

00:05:55.040 --> 00:05:58.040
Yes. I still have to work
on the church's repairs.

00:05:58.400 --> 00:05:59.490
As for Shino...

00:05:59.490 --> 00:06:00.670
Please look after him for me.

00:06:03.530 --> 00:06:06.240
And here he's really worried sick.

00:06:07.300 --> 00:06:10.640
Kenro Hotel

00:06:07.960 --> 00:06:11.320
Man, you really had
me shocked back there!

00:06:11.320 --> 00:06:13.710
I thought I'd caught a glimpse of the

00:06:13.710 --> 00:06:16.020
almighty Satomi's innermost bedchambers.

00:06:16.380 --> 00:06:18.670
What about my "innermost bedchambers"?

00:06:18.670 --> 00:06:20.150
How absurd.

00:06:20.150 --> 00:06:22.880
But I am astonished that
you sustained such injury

00:06:22.880 --> 00:06:25.280
while in Yatsufusa's presence.

00:06:25.850 --> 00:06:30.280
There is only one person capable of
doing this to Rio, and that's Shii.

00:06:30.940 --> 00:06:33.280
Still, I'm surprised.

00:06:33.730 --> 00:06:36.200
Is this supposed to be Shii's true form?

00:06:37.490 --> 00:06:38.960
Wasn't he 18?

00:06:40.200 --> 00:06:43.640
Guess it wasn't too nice of me
to treat him like a little kid, huh?

00:06:44.410 --> 00:06:46.860
But still, what is this all about?

00:06:47.420 --> 00:06:49.300
Did he break Murasame's curse?

00:06:49.470 --> 00:06:51.150
It will take more than this to break it.

00:06:53.960 --> 00:06:55.650
He went through a great
deal yesterday...

00:06:56.340 --> 00:06:57.730
This is probably only temporary.

00:06:58.290 --> 00:07:00.190
Thanks to which, I was made to suffer.

00:07:00.550 --> 00:07:02.440
I'm not sure whether to call it foolish

00:07:02.440 --> 00:07:04.850
or typical of Shino to try to eat you.

00:07:06.430 --> 00:07:07.200
I'm coming in.

00:07:09.420 --> 00:07:10.400
A guest?

00:07:11.170 --> 00:07:12.320
I'm Osaki.

00:07:12.570 --> 00:07:14.200
Huh? THE Osaki?!

00:07:14.690 --> 00:07:16.190
As in one of the Four Houses
of the Sacred Beasts?

00:07:16.190 --> 00:07:17.200
That's right.

00:07:17.990 --> 00:07:21.460
Oh, I'm sorry. I heard
that Shino got hurt.

00:07:21.950 --> 00:07:24.210
The innkeeper told me to drop this off.

00:07:24.740 --> 00:07:27.160
Oh, are you that guy from Kona-ya?

00:07:27.160 --> 00:07:28.330
Yeah, I'm Kobungo Inuta.

00:07:29.290 --> 00:07:30.340
How is Shino holding up?

00:07:30.920 --> 00:07:32.930
He's sleeping like a babe.

00:07:33.500 --> 00:07:35.720
So, did you learn anything?

00:07:36.210 --> 00:07:40.230
I did some homework on the woman
that was with Shino yesterday.

00:07:40.980 --> 00:07:42.230
Her name is Kohaku.

00:07:42.880 --> 00:07:44.910
Supposedly she was sold into
the red-light district at the age of eight.

00:07:45.840 --> 00:07:48.300
Her village was destroyed
three years ago.

00:07:49.260 --> 00:07:52.360
It was the northern village
where Princess Sai got kidnapped.

00:07:52.930 --> 00:07:54.090
I'm sure you remember the incident.

00:07:56.110 --> 00:07:59.370
And what does that have to do with this?

00:07:59.760 --> 00:08:01.760
You are Shino's guardian.

00:08:02.870 --> 00:08:05.980
I originally thought that he was
in the wrong place at the wrong time,

00:08:06.380 --> 00:08:10.380
Winter Daphne Inn

00:08:06.740 --> 00:08:10.380
but a woman's body was just found
at the Winter Daphne Inn.

00:08:11.000 --> 00:08:12.210
Her name was Chitose.

00:08:13.290 --> 00:08:17.040
Supposedly her body was torn apart
as if attacked by an animal.

00:08:18.210 --> 00:08:21.670
Furthermore, Kohaku has vanished
from the Winter Daphne Inn.

00:08:30.100 --> 00:08:32.970
In short, you believe
that this Kohaku woman

00:08:32.970 --> 00:08:34.910
was the one who killed Chitose?

00:08:35.520 --> 00:08:37.410
It is highly likely...

00:08:37.860 --> 00:08:39.180
And these past few days,

00:08:39.180 --> 00:08:41.980
Kohaku has been
talking about Shino an awful lot.

00:08:42.860 --> 00:08:45.260
Meaning that Shii was dead
in the center of the incident

00:08:45.260 --> 00:08:48.150
rather than a bystander who
got caught up in things?

00:08:48.150 --> 00:08:49.920
I can't say for certain, but...

00:08:52.490 --> 00:08:54.620
Shino, you still asleep?

00:08:54.620 --> 00:08:55.500
Kobungo?

00:08:56.080 --> 00:08:57.680
What? You were already awake?

00:08:58.210 --> 00:09:00.130
The lady of the inn asked me to bring...

00:09:02.050 --> 00:09:04.370
Do you think Kohaku is
possessed by something?

00:09:06.300 --> 00:09:07.470
What's wrong, Kobungo?

00:09:07.470 --> 00:09:08.780
Stop making that strange sound.

00:09:08.780 --> 00:09:11.190
Aw, crud! I didn't see nothin'!

00:09:12.060 --> 00:09:14.890
Anyway, Bro! Shouldn't you be goin'?

00:09:14.890 --> 00:09:17.470
Go on! Thanks for all
yer hard work today!

00:09:17.470 --> 00:09:18.520
Now beat it!

00:09:18.520 --> 00:09:20.070
What gives? Where did this come from?

00:09:20.070 --> 00:09:21.490
It doesn't matter! Now get!

00:09:21.490 --> 00:09:23.880
Before I go, I'd like
to take a peek at Shino.

00:09:23.880 --> 00:09:26.980
Shuddup! Get yer ass
in gear, ya stupid bro!

00:09:28.430 --> 00:09:29.210
What in the...?

00:09:31.380 --> 00:09:33.500
Is-is that Sh-Sh-Sh-Sh-Shi...?

00:09:33.500 --> 00:09:36.440
Well, I guess this
would surprise anyone.

00:09:36.780 --> 00:09:39.460
Kobungo, I'm starvin'.
Fork over the food.

00:09:40.550 --> 00:09:42.460
Shino!

00:09:44.380 --> 00:09:46.730
That was such a freakin' big surprise!

00:09:47.060 --> 00:09:49.840
I thought Shino was this
really puny little brat,

00:09:49.840 --> 00:09:53.710
but he's actually a full-blown
adult that's merely trapped

00:09:53.710 --> 00:09:56.020
in a child's body 'cause
of Murasame's curse!

00:09:57.300 --> 00:10:01.850
But if Bro learned the
truth about Shino...!

00:10:02.610 --> 00:10:05.360
Kobungo, may I eat this?

00:10:05.360 --> 00:10:05.870
Sure!

00:10:06.120 --> 00:10:09.380
Tell the innkeeper I'll
go thank her later.

00:10:09.880 --> 00:10:12.880
Crap! He's totally Bro's type!

00:10:34.510 --> 00:10:35.850
Kohaku!

00:10:36.520 --> 00:10:39.070
I wonder why...

00:10:39.890 --> 00:10:45.410
For some reason, this is
as far as I can go today.

00:10:47.070 --> 00:10:48.170
Chitose...

00:10:49.900 --> 00:10:52.330
We've been together since I was eight.

00:10:53.280 --> 00:10:55.460
Just like me, her parents sold her.

00:10:56.740 --> 00:10:57.840
We were always together...

00:10:59.870 --> 00:11:05.850
Lately, I have been remembering
all kinds of things from my childhood.

00:11:06.840 --> 00:11:07.850
Did it start...

00:11:08.130 --> 00:11:09.330
...after you met Shino?

00:11:11.130 --> 00:11:14.370
Her life was supposed to
have already burnt out.

00:11:14.950 --> 00:11:18.320
The one keeping her alive
like this is probably Shino.

00:11:19.220 --> 00:11:22.550
Shino unconsciously gave
her a strong wish...

00:11:24.610 --> 00:11:29.370
Hey, aren't I a bit short for 18?

00:11:29.740 --> 00:11:32.200
You have always been on the short side.

00:11:32.200 --> 00:11:33.260
What?!

00:11:33.910 --> 00:11:34.880
Now then...

00:11:35.460 --> 00:11:37.000
It's time I best be off.

00:11:37.580 --> 00:11:38.540
Where to?

00:11:38.540 --> 00:11:39.580
The Winter Daphne Inn.

00:11:40.270 --> 00:11:41.500
Then I'm going, too!

00:11:42.740 --> 00:11:45.260
Sosuke is at the church near there.

00:11:46.420 --> 00:11:47.900
It would be for the best

00:11:47.900 --> 00:11:50.020
if you avoided going out
as much as possible.

00:11:50.340 --> 00:11:54.280
But I just gotta show
Sosuke how awesome I look!

00:11:54.280 --> 00:11:55.760
Same for Hamaji.

00:11:55.760 --> 00:11:57.820
Didn't this incident teach you anything?

00:11:58.930 --> 00:12:02.470
When your powers take action in earnest,
no one can stop them.

00:12:03.270 --> 00:12:05.440
It is a testament to how
dangerous they can be.

00:12:06.400 --> 00:12:07.810
Try to bear that in mind.

00:12:11.110 --> 00:12:13.260
Guess he's still the same on the inside.

00:12:13.780 --> 00:12:14.500
Fine...

00:12:15.360 --> 00:12:16.720
I won't enter the red-light district.

00:12:17.450 --> 00:12:18.780
I'll just go to the church...

00:12:19.700 --> 00:12:21.550
I'll just... see So...

00:12:24.420 --> 00:12:25.960
Then I shall drop you off.

00:12:29.990 --> 00:12:31.670
Nothing changes...

00:12:32.400 --> 00:12:34.560
Nothing about me has changed.

00:12:35.940 --> 00:12:37.790
I thought I could not change.

00:12:38.780 --> 00:12:41.970
At least, not until that
day I visited the church...

00:12:42.920 --> 00:12:46.510
In your current state, that
is as far as you can enter.

00:12:57.930 --> 00:12:59.250
I am truly sorry.

00:13:00.120 --> 00:13:04.060
It is not in my power to save you...

00:13:05.160 --> 00:13:07.870
Is it because I met that child?

00:13:09.090 --> 00:13:10.360
Is that why I am...

00:13:11.690 --> 00:13:13.130
...becoming something not human?

00:13:14.640 --> 00:13:16.650
It's because that is what you desired.

00:13:19.730 --> 00:13:21.900
You made a deal with something.

00:13:22.600 --> 00:13:25.590
Although Shino may have
been the one to have

00:13:25.590 --> 00:13:27.170
granted power to your strong desire...

00:13:29.160 --> 00:13:31.590
My desire...

00:13:36.880 --> 00:13:38.010
Mr. Satomi!

00:13:38.820 --> 00:13:43.670
What was the wish that you so desperately
wanted to see fulfilled?

00:13:45.680 --> 00:13:47.720
I had younger brothers
back in that village.

00:13:49.420 --> 00:13:50.810
They were still young.

00:13:51.300 --> 00:13:52.310
I had friends as well...

00:13:54.380 --> 00:13:56.910
Why didn't you save them?

00:13:58.790 --> 00:14:02.690
By the time I arrived, all of
the villagers were already dead.

00:14:04.190 --> 00:14:05.310
I'm sorry...

00:14:06.060 --> 00:14:08.310
I did not mean to throw
the blame on you.

00:14:09.240 --> 00:14:10.350
I had forgotten everything.

00:14:10.930 --> 00:14:13.800
About the village, my
parents, my siblings...

00:14:14.650 --> 00:14:16.590
...and even my kind friends.

00:14:17.400 --> 00:14:19.570
When I heard that the
village had been wiped out,

00:14:20.030 --> 00:14:21.520
I didn't feel a thing.

00:14:22.530 --> 00:14:25.540
Same for when I learned that I was ill
and didn't have much time left.

00:14:26.320 --> 00:14:29.120
I simply accepted things as they were.

00:14:31.820 --> 00:14:33.740
But at least once before I go...

00:14:34.500 --> 00:14:39.170
I wanted to meet the person
who witnessed the end of my village.

00:14:41.140 --> 00:14:43.740
And there, I met an angel.

00:14:46.270 --> 00:14:47.880
I felt that a tainted

00:14:47.880 --> 00:14:50.860
individual such as myself
had no right to enter his gaze.

00:14:51.860 --> 00:14:53.350
That's how pure his eyes seemed...

00:14:54.980 --> 00:14:57.150
I must not draw near him...

00:14:57.150 --> 00:14:59.290
He lives in a world
different from my own.

00:15:00.280 --> 00:15:01.170
And yet...

00:15:03.910 --> 00:15:08.510
May you be blessed with
God's forgiveness and protection.

00:15:14.500 --> 00:15:15.510
I...

00:15:16.350 --> 00:15:19.350
I wanted to leave an image
of myself in those eyes...!

00:15:20.130 --> 00:15:25.110
At the least, I may have been able
to remain in that angel's heart...

00:15:25.390 --> 00:15:28.320
If only I could leave the
image of a happy me with him.

00:15:29.270 --> 00:15:32.330
The image of happiness
that I could never obtain,

00:15:32.840 --> 00:15:33.740
even if it was a lie.

00:15:36.860 --> 00:15:38.880
I can remember everything clearly now.

00:15:40.110 --> 00:15:41.960
My father's disgruntled face...

00:15:42.460 --> 00:15:44.500
My mother's sobbing voice...

00:15:45.280 --> 00:15:50.120
My tiny brothers' desperate hands
trying to keep me from leaving...

00:15:51.750 --> 00:15:53.690
And here I had forgotten...!

00:15:55.080 --> 00:15:57.330
I had forgotten all about how I was...

00:15:58.480 --> 00:15:59.390
alone!

00:16:02.880 --> 00:16:05.110
Aren't I a horrible woman?

00:16:05.470 --> 00:16:07.370
I am placing all of the
blame on that child...

00:16:10.350 --> 00:16:11.260
That's why...

00:16:13.110 --> 00:16:14.800
That's why I made a wish.

00:16:16.360 --> 00:16:18.310
I... I wish...

00:16:19.820 --> 00:16:21.480
...that I would just disappear!

00:16:31.410 --> 00:16:33.880
You are very much like Shino.

00:16:35.460 --> 00:16:38.040
Inside your heart lies
a hidden strength.

00:16:39.350 --> 00:16:43.390
But at the same time, that very strength
is also quite fragile...

00:16:44.330 --> 00:16:45.430
In reality,

00:16:46.700 --> 00:16:50.880
you cannot live to the fullest
unless you do so for another.

00:16:51.670 --> 00:16:53.400
What would you know...?

00:16:54.770 --> 00:16:56.350
What would you know?!

00:16:56.350 --> 00:16:58.320
Sosuke, that's enough.

00:17:00.020 --> 00:17:00.900
Shino?

00:17:04.110 --> 00:17:05.290
Are you...

00:17:06.290 --> 00:17:07.540
...that child?

00:17:08.800 --> 00:17:10.300
I'm sorry, Kohaku.

00:17:11.280 --> 00:17:13.960
I did something I shouldn't have, huh?

00:17:15.480 --> 00:17:17.310
I didn't realize how painful

00:17:17.310 --> 00:17:20.140
it would be for you to
remember everything.

00:17:21.430 --> 00:17:22.980
I didn't know that there are times

00:17:22.980 --> 00:17:26.700
when it's easier to live
having forgotten such things.

00:17:28.430 --> 00:17:30.070
"I'm not afraid to die."

00:17:30.670 --> 00:17:32.190
"Living is far more scary."

00:17:33.100 --> 00:17:38.220
There are some who feel that way,
yet I never realized that.

00:17:40.020 --> 00:17:42.330
That's why I hate...

00:17:42.770 --> 00:17:43.880
...children.

00:17:45.580 --> 00:17:46.370
I'm sorry.

00:17:48.030 --> 00:17:48.830
Murasame...

00:17:58.340 --> 00:17:59.270
You see,

00:18:00.030 --> 00:18:02.510
even though I must
live with this monster

00:18:02.510 --> 00:18:04.050
and a body that cannot die,

00:18:05.170 --> 00:18:07.100
I'm still afraid of death.

00:18:08.880 --> 00:18:10.000
Isn't that nuts?

00:18:11.390 --> 00:18:15.560
Coughing up blood, struggling to breathe
and writhing in agony...

00:18:17.390 --> 00:18:19.100
My body fully remembers
what it was like.

00:18:20.690 --> 00:18:22.730
Even though I knew dying
would make the pain go away,

00:18:23.520 --> 00:18:25.490
I'll never forget the
fear I felt back then...

00:18:26.600 --> 00:18:27.480
Kohaku,

00:18:28.580 --> 00:18:30.880
doesn't death scare you?

00:18:32.950 --> 00:18:34.380
To me...

00:18:34.960 --> 00:18:39.470
...turning into a monster and
living all on my own

00:18:40.620 --> 00:18:42.780
is far scarier.

00:18:52.740 --> 00:18:54.400
You aren't a monster.

00:18:55.060 --> 00:18:55.970
Kohaku...

00:18:58.250 --> 00:19:00.340
You're like an angel
from a picture book.

00:19:02.690 --> 00:19:04.190
You're really pretty!

00:19:47.020 --> 00:19:51.960
Thanks to Shino, I failed
to collect the other eye.

00:19:52.570 --> 00:19:55.960
Still, Shino can be
most cruel, can't he?

00:19:56.620 --> 00:19:58.860
A monster is nothing
more than a monster.

00:19:59.540 --> 00:20:02.300
No matter how it pretends to be a human,

00:20:03.120 --> 00:20:05.110
it can never go back to being a person.

00:20:08.460 --> 00:20:11.250
There is no need for
you to feel so guilty.

00:20:13.130 --> 00:20:15.500
I am certain that Kohaku
isn't angry with you.

00:20:18.600 --> 00:20:20.190
Now then.

00:20:20.810 --> 00:20:23.990
Could you let me get a
good look at you, Shino?

00:20:28.520 --> 00:20:31.740
You have grown to be far more comely
than I had imagined.

00:20:32.390 --> 00:20:34.760
We simply must let Hamaji see you.

00:20:36.400 --> 00:20:38.010
Would you like to go see her now?

00:20:38.850 --> 00:20:40.010
Could it wait until tomorrow?

00:20:40.700 --> 00:20:42.240
I'm feeling beat today.

00:20:43.710 --> 00:20:46.160
Very well. Please wait here.

00:20:46.520 --> 00:20:47.990
I will fetch some tea.

00:20:52.810 --> 00:20:53.990
You know, Kohaku...

00:20:55.640 --> 00:20:58.640
I told you that I'm
afraid of dying, but...

00:20:59.710 --> 00:21:03.210
But if I was alone in the
world, stuck all by myself...

00:21:03.930 --> 00:21:08.000
I think that would be far more painful
than going through death.

00:21:09.320 --> 00:21:10.170
But even so...

00:21:24.500 --> 00:21:25.460
Oh well....

00:21:25.860 --> 00:21:28.740
Someday, I swear I will...

00:21:29.710 --> 00:21:33.830
As long as at least one person
was there to hold my hand,

00:21:34.420 --> 00:21:40.710
I don't think I'd be
afraid to live or die.

00:23:13.530 --> 00:23:16.290
KONA-YA

00:23:14.880 --> 00:23:16.290
Damn it all!

00:23:16.650 --> 00:23:19.940
I can't find hide nor hair of that man!

00:23:20.360 --> 00:23:22.420
Did I not tell you this
would end in vain?

00:23:21.400 --> 00:23:23.500
Where the hell'd he go?!

00:23:22.910 --> 00:23:24.670
It's like trying to step
on your own shadow.

00:23:26.120 --> 00:23:41.130
Karma

00:23:26.620 --> 00:23:28.020
Satomi, gimme money!

00:23:28.450 --> 00:23:31.120
I believe I said that you weren't getting
any allowance for a while.

00:23:31.120 --> 00:23:32.620
But it's for my necessities!

00:23:32.620 --> 00:23:33.500
What necessities?

00:23:33.500 --> 00:23:36.060
Yoshiro's lotion, Yoshiro's powder,

00:23:36.060 --> 00:23:38.560
Yoshiro's nail clippers and Yoshiro's shampoo!

00:23:39.060 --> 00:23:40.270
Really, now...
